      "section": "dsh-plugin-cost-tracker",
      "text": "Token cost tracker for DeepSeek Harness."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "- Tracks token usage per session\n- Calculates costs based on model pricing\n- Injects cost awareness into system prompt\n- Provides CLI tool for cost estimation"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile your-profile add dsh-plugin-cost-tracker\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "CLI",
      "text": "```sh\ncost --model deepseek-v4 --input 10000 --output 5000"
    },
    {
      "section": "Cost: $0.01",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Supported models",
      "text": "- deepseek-v4, deepseek-v4-flash, deepseek-r1, deepseek-vl2\n- gpt-4o, gpt-4o-mini, gpt-5.2\n- claude-sonnet-4, claude-opus-4, claude-haiku-4\n- gemini-2.5-pro, gemini-2.5-flash"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "```yaml\n- id: cost-tracker\n  name: dsh-plugin-cost-tracker\n  config:\n    defaultModel: deepseek-v4"
